                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nThe length of a list.\n\nThis function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`, which uses constant stack space.\n\nExamples:\n* `([] : List String).length = 0`\n* `[\"green\", \"brown\"].length = 2`",
