                        {
                          "id": "b78ea3b9-209a-4a87-b73a-3a5117de2afe",
                          "text": "签名: ∀ {α : Sort u} {a b : α}, a = b → b = a",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "13696b33-e6ac-4080-84ed-2d179a848c7d",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**签名**\n\n∀ {α : Sort u} {a b : α}, a = b → b = a",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "签名"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "13d89bd1-3533-4985-b508-7f95a176373e",
                          "text": "文档: Equality is symmetric: if `a = b` then `b = a`. Because this is in the `Eq` nam…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "13696b33-e6ac-4080-84ed-2d179a848c7d",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nEquality is symmetric: if `a = b` then `b = a`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have a variable `h : a = b`,\n`h.symm` can be used as shorthand for `Eq.symm h` as a proof of `b = a`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "6f26284d-c150-4e81-a449-b1b002cdc535",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute-group"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f3f4f6",
                        "color": "#4b5563",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "shape": "round",
                        "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "925cfb20-90c9-4429-b02a-fa101823d122",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {a b : α}, a = b → b = a\n```\n\n**文档**\nEquality is symmetric: if `a = b` then `b = a`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have a variable `h : a = b`,\n`h.symm` can be used as shorthand for `Eq.symm h` as a proof of `b = a`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
