                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "fd551b32-f812-46c7-b044-cd60dd5212c9",
                          "text": "文档: Equality is transitive: if `a = b` and `b = c` then `a = c`. Because this is in…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "92dcd5c7-0482-4583-b0b0-41d91ed60d2c",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nEquality is transitive: if `a = b` and `b = c` then `a = c`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have variables or expressions\n`h₁ : a = b` and `h₂ : b = c`, you can use `h₁.trans h₂ : a = c` as shorthand\nfor `Eq.trans h₁ h₂`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "00409ae1-a697-4df0-b0ad-058f548e5dcb",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute-group"
