                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f3f4f6",
                        "color": "#4b5563",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "shape": "round",
                        "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "925cfb20-90c9-4429-b02a-fa101823d122",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {a b c : α}, a = b → b = c → a = c\n```\n\n**文档**\nEquality is transitive: if `a = b` and `b = c` then `a = c`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have variables or expressions\n`h₁ : a = b` and `h₂ : b = c`, you can use `h₁.trans h₂ : a = c` as shorthand\nfor `Eq.trans h₁ h₂`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
