                        {
                          "id": "90d9861c-e19f-473a-bf3f-504470c09e0a",
                          "text": "签名: ∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {f₁ f₂ : α → β} {a₁ a₂ : α}, f₁ = f₂ → a₁ = a₂ → f₁…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "d45f938a-c83f-4de7-bb20-a97172a7790c",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**签名**\n\n∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {f₁ f₂ : α → β} {a₁ a₂ : α}, f₁ = f₂ → a₁ = a₂ → f₁ a₁ = f₂ a₂",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "签名"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "3f0e3389-bf35-41f5-a018-7e6481d2275c",
                          "text": "文档: Congruence in both function and argument. If `f₁ = f₂` and `a₁ = a₂` then `f₁ a…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "d45f938a-c83f-4de7-bb20-a97172a7790c",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nCongruence in both function and argument. If `f₁ = f₂` and `a₁ = a₂` then\n`f₁ a₁ = f₂ a₂`. This only works for nondependent functions; the theorem\nstatement is more complex in the dependent case.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
