                        {
                          "id": "2cb29c7d-7ab5-4597-ad16-249233020c94",
                          "text": "签名: {α : Type u} → (x : ℕ) → [self : OfNat α x] → α",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "3ce370ac-bc10-412d-a280-e7c295bb9de6",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**签名**\n\n{α : Type u} → (x : ℕ) → [self : OfNat α x] → α",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "签名"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "4f51f809-d65c-47d0-a298-4c4545908889",
                          "text": "文档: The `OfNat.ofNat` function is automatically inserted by the parser when the use…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "3ce370ac-bc10-412d-a280-e7c295bb9de6",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nThe `OfNat.ofNat` function is automatically inserted by the parser when\nthe user writes a numeric literal like `1 : α`. Implementations of this\ntypeclass can therefore customize the behavior of `n : α` based on `n` and\n`α`.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "e660c20c-ea13-4451-a4f1-83840dc5136c",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute-group"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f3f4f6",
                        "color": "#4b5563",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "shape": "round",
                        "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "5aaf6c26-8187-4c87-a844-8266817f066d",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → (x : ℕ) → [self : OfNat α x] → α\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe `OfNat.ofNat` function is automatically inserted by the parser when\nthe user writes a numeric literal like `1 : α`. Implementations of this\ntypeclass can therefore customize the behavior of `n : α` based on `n` and\n`α`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
