                        {
                          "id": "df7c15fa-2274-43b1-87d3-993ee4178372",
                          "text": "文档: The natural numbers, starting at zero. This type is special-cased by both the k…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "33383d9f-ecea-4510-8a38-98dadbba6495",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nThe natural numbers, starting at zero.\n\nThis type is special-cased by both the kernel and the compiler, and overridden with an efficient\nimplementation. Both use a fast arbitrary-precision arithmetic library (usually\n[GMP](https://gmplib.org/)); at runtime, `Nat` values that are sufficiently small are unboxed.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
