                        {
                          "id": "939dc3be-e1b9-4d21-905b-b5fbbbd1690d",
                          "text": "签名: Prop → Prop → Prop",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "0843702f-2500-4e91-9f37-dd31387a4075",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**签名**\n\nProp → Prop → Prop",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "签名"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "8cdbd518-50eb-4bd5-b655-7c9b41d7ac40",
                          "text": "文档: If and only if, or logical bi-implication. `a ↔ b` means that `a` implies `b` a…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "0843702f-2500-4e91-9f37-dd31387a4075",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nIf and only if, or logical bi-implication. `a ↔ b` means that `a` implies `b` and vice versa.\nBy `propext`, this implies that `a` and `b` are equal and hence any expression involving `a`\nis equivalent to the corresponding expression with `b` instead.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "65f73b2f-1f40-4583-accb-478be70703af",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
