                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "67594133-2d87-4e06-b06e-6dcb95bd93c9",
                          "text": "文档: If `a → b` and `b → a` then `a` and `b` are equivalent.",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "785dfb1d-ffda-4973-820a-2592e50bfc3e",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nIf `a → b` and `b → a` then `a` and `b` are equivalent.",
