                        {
                          "id": "56da9506-9270-4ddb-bbe1-32b83fd2f44a",
                          "text": "文档: A product type in which the types may be propositions, usually written `α ×' β`…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "ee6478f0-4526-4549-9f5a-d4816c6b82cd",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nA product type in which the types may be propositions, usually written `α ×' β`.\n\nThis type is primarily used internally and as an implementation detail of proof automation. It is\nrarely useful in hand-written code.",
